<title>LATVIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 20.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 20.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines on Latvia's state radio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- A seminar has opened in Christiansand in Norway on doing business with Latvia.</p>
<p>- The traditional pre-Ligo craftwork and flowers market opened in Doma Laukums.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
